WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:04.250
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.610
One Hyper Mega Hamburger Bento!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.990
Got it, one Megaburger.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.710
<i>My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.</i>

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.460
<i>I'm your ordinary first-year middle school student.</i>

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.130
Ichigo, get the rice.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:25.710
Okay!

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.730
Sorry for the wait,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.910
and thanks as always.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:53.500
Thanks.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.300
Thank you very much!

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.200
Good work.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.450
That one really looked like him!

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.570
Totally, right?

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.770
Okay, let's get everything ready!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.630
<i>Back then, I would never have imagined,</i>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.250
<i>that I,</i>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.630
<i><i>me</i>,</i>

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:15.730
<i>someone like me could become an idol!</i>

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.390
Hi, signalize!

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:41.730
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:41.730
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.620
No, that's wrong

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.620
iie chigau yo

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:49.000
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:49.000
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.790
Do that signalize!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:55.970
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:55.970
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.930
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.930
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.470
So I'll believe in the present

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.470
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:08.640
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:08.640
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.980
Chance for me

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:15.280
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:15.280
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.490
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.490
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.410
Where are we headed?

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.410
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.160
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.160
mabushii kibou no nake e

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.420
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.420
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.800
Where we're headed

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.800
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.680
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.680
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:50.020
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:50.020
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:13.910
I'm back!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.630
Welcome home.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.390
Alright, you can go now, Ichigo.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.180
Okay, after a bit more.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.930
Thanks for always helping out.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.430
Not a problem.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.870
Though, you know, Ichigo,

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:36.230
you should try finding something <i>you</i> want to do, instead of spending all your time helping me out.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.160
Huh?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:38.710
What do you mean?

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:42.200
I've wanted to run a bento shop since I was a little girl.

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:46.370
I was thinking that you should follow your dreams, too, Ichigo.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.490
My dreams?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.930
I wonder...

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.000
My dream might be to run a bento shop too!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:55.630
Huh?

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.570
Mama, you seem to have fun every day

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.130
and I do too.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:05.140
So maybe my dream is to run a bento shop with you even when I grow up.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.720
Then I've got to keep on going at it!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.520
Yep!

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.500
Raichi, I'm back.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.380
Hey there.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.920
What's that?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.920
Onee-chan, weren't you helping out with the shop?

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.600
I'm sorry!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.750
I'll do it myself!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.540
Isn't she...

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.800
Kanzaki Mizuki?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.770
It's fine, isn't it?

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.160
That's fine, but...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.540
do you like her?

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.130
It's fine, isn't it?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.500
Is it still fine...

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.030
even though you spilled that on her?

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:49.680
It's fine, isn't it?!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.710
Is it fine?

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.140
Of course not!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.110
I spent so long collecting these too...

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.480
So Raichi, you like idols?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:05.280
I had no idea.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.570
She's not just any old idol!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.260
Kanzaki Mizuki is the <i>top</i> idol!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:13.100
I really wanted to go to her show,

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.330
but there aren't any tickets left.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.590
I'll try asking my friend if she can help tomorrow.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.260
Aoi-chan knows a lot about idols!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.720
Oh yeah, Aoi.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.480
Yeah?

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.600
My little brother was saying he wanted to go to this idol's show...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.870
That's strange.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.190
I've never heard you talk about idols before.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.490
Rather than me, it's my brother...

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.000
Let's go!

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.120
I'll help you out!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.780
Yeah...

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.120
I heard all about it.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:58.120
Who's this?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.220
This is my best friend, Kiriya Aoi-chan.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.270
She really loves idols.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:06.650
Rather than love, I'm a research expert on them.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.130
Here!

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.510
Clippings of Kanzaki Mizuki-chan.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.300
I'll let you have some of my collection!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.520
And some posters too!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.980
There's so much Mizuki-chan!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:21.360
Thanks!

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:27.740
Oh yeah, Raichi said that he wanted to go to Kanzaki Mizuki's concert.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.870
I figured he could just watch it on TV or something...

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.110
No, no, no.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:33.790
Huh?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.370
You have to see concerts live!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.860
Really?

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.500
I've never been to one myself.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.030
Well, me neither...

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:41.090
Right?

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:44.130
Like your brother said, you've got to watch concerts live.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.010
Exactly, Nee-san!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.250
Your sister is <i>Ichigo</i>.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.390
You're so cool!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:54.690
But as you know, it's almost impossible to get hold of a ticket to Mizuki-sama's concert.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:56.240
Like I thought...

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.970
However, I've got some good news for you.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.610
What?!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.900
We can go to the concert?!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.830
How, why?

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.660
I went and checked if I had a good connection.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.660
Yeah, yeah?

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:17.740
Then I found out that my Dad's cousin's daughter's second cousin's

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.670
classmate that he hadn't met in several years

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:25.160
has a son who's little league team's manager's mother's brother

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:29.150
met a Frenchman at a travel agency while on vacation

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:33.500
who just happened to be looked after by a nice old Japanese woman while he was in Japan,

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.890
She really went out of her way to find those tickets...

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.640
She's super amazing!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:40.150
After that,  I was finally able to get 
tickets to Kanzaki Mizuki's concert!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:42.140
Three of them, for free!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.690
Really!?

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.440
So let's get ready and go!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.690
To Mizuki-sama's concert!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.590
Yeah!

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.180
Onee-chan, it's almost here!

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.670
Mizuki-sama's concert's tomorrow!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.450
Yep!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.610
It'll definitely be great.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:00.560
Yeah.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:01.970
My heart's pounding so much.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:03.080
Sure...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.570
But anyway, let's sleep.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.570
Impossible!

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:10.590
Wha—

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.510
What're you doing?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.060
I'm so excited I can't sleep.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.100
And I'm worried that I won't wake up in time...

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.710
But you still have to sleep.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.120
Okay?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.110
Yeah.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.350
<i>Idols...</i>

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:34.140
<i>Are they really so great they keep you up at night?</i>

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.290
Awesome!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.370
Let's get a move on.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.040
It's going to start soon.

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:50.000
Please enjoy the concert!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.390
Here you are.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:59.500
If you put that antenna on your head, you'll be able to see the audience's excitement.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.890
Excitement?

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.400
Come on, hurry!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.560
Mizuki-sama...

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:33.230
<i>Kanzaki... Mizuki...</i>

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:58.570
<i>Kanzaki... Mizuki!</i>

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.840
Here it comes!

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.270
It's a special appeal!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.450
We're home!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.010
Welcome back.

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:26.740
How was it?

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.650
Unbelievable!

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.160
Right?

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.400
Somehow...

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.670
I don't really remember much...

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:40.670
Huh? Really?

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.130
<i>Of course...</i>

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:46.400
<i>I've never seen anything like that before.</i>

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:51.190
<i>I don't really understand it, but somehow...</i>

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:55.450
<i>I get the feeling that I won't be able to sleep tonight.</i>

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.730
I'm home.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:14.600
Welcome back.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.420
Oh? What are you two doing all snuggled up?

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.940
Watching an idol?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:18.800
Yeah.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:23.080
I would've gone shopping with you if you asked.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:23.800
Don't worry about it.

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.930
Mizuki-chan was amazing!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.810
You're glad you went, right?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.010
Yeah!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.030
It really was great that you came!

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:33.810
Aoi?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.480
Nee-san!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.010
Come on in.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:40.010
Ichigo, I've got more good news.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.070
Huh?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.070
You probably haven't heard of this school, right?

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:46.070
Ah!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.020
It's Starlight Academy!

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.030
Starlight Academy?

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.160
You don't know it?

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.070
That's what I expected.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:56.590
Starlight Academy is Japan's number one idol school.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:00.970
All of the students are active idols.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:04.360
They have lessons using the Aikatsu System every day.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.160
Aikatsu System?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.930
Oh, come on...

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.660
To performers, these cards are life itself.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:16.980
All of the idols in the world use the Aikatsu Cards, and choose what they want to look like on stage.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:20.260
They take lessons and do "Idol Activities",

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:23.860
in other words, "Aikatsu", as the main curriculum of Starlight Academy.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.130
Mizuki-sama goes there too.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.320
Huh? She does?

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.250
Wow, it's true.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.190
That's right!

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.090
Starlight Academy's top student is none other than

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.770
Kanzaki Mizuki!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.710
Wow...

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.930
And so, here's the good news:

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:46.340
Starlight Academy is going to be holding entrance exams!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.840
Entrance exams?

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.350
I'm going to take them.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.680
You're gonna be an idol?

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.870
That would be so cool!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.910
That's amazing, Aoi.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.980
What'll you do if you pass?

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:03.440
I'll have to transfer.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:07.330
Of course... so we'll be going to different schools.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.390
No, we won't.

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.530
Huh?

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.030
You're taking it with me.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.150
Eh?

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:13.990
Huh?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.720
Ehh?!

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:19.750
Onee-chan... an idol?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.860
I can tell!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.550
Ichigo has the scent of an idol!

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.440
What are you saying?

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.020
Doesn't it sound fun?

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:35.690
You can be an idol like Mizuki-chan!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.030
It does... sound fun.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.280
Then let's take the tests together!

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.460
It's fine even if you just tag along.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.450
Tag along?

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:54.110
Onee-chan, why don't you give it a try?

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.220
The most important thing

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:00.920
is the desire to become an idol!

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:03.880
Let's do what we can!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:07.420
We'll take that scoop, and turn it into a mic!

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.450
Thanks for the food!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:21.830
Let's eat.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:25.590
What's wrong, Ichigo?

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:28.640
She's going to turn her scoop—

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:29.300
That's enough!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:31.820
Thanks for the food.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:41.720
<i>If I became an idol like Mizuki-chan...</i>

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.000
<i>I'm sure it'd be fun, but...</i>

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.470
<i>My dream is to run a bento shop with you even when I grow up.</i>

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:51.980
Ichigo.

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:54.110
Mama!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.900
If there's something you want to do, go do it.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.560
Did Raichi tell you?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.480
Yep!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:11.670
Kanzaki Mizuki... she's got a good expression.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.330
You think so too?

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.500
Yeah.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:17.750
Now that that scoop, and make it a mic!

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.630
Now that that's decided, our special training starts today!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:27.160
Right! Let's give it our all!

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:29.630
Yeah!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.800
<i>While I was watching that dream-like world</i>

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.390
<i>I might've found my own dream!</i>

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.530
<i>I wonder if I can do it...</i>

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.210
<i>And become an idol like Mizuki-chan!</i>

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:20.760
This is...

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.750
There are about 1000 applicants,

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.770
and the exam is so difficult that nobody might get in.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.260
But still...

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.690
Nothing to it but to do it!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:31.360
Yeah!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:38.620
What is the reason you decided upon this school?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.530
I've been studying dance since I was a child,

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.120
and it naturally came to me that I should be following the path to becoming an idol.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.490
Everyone here is so amazing...

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:51.430
Be confident, Ichigo.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:55.350
I told you, didn't I? You've got the scent of an idol.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.050
What does that even mean?

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.970
You're suited to be an idol.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.800
I can tell!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.530
I wonder...

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:05.660
Anyway, it's finally the live audition.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.330
Let's not give up until the end!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:08.940
Right!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:28.170
The entrance audition is now beginning.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:33.260
Choose three Aikatsu cards to coordinate your outfit,

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.340
and then proceed to the stage.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:37.800
Yes!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.770
<i>Mama,</i>

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.160
<i>Raichi.</i>

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.080
<i>Here I go!</i>

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:19.760
Applicant 367, Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.030
Quite a nice coord.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:28.040
<i>This is the Aikatsu stage!</i>

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.960
That aura!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:17.320
<i>This is fun!</i>

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:20.130
<i>I want to do this forever!</i>

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:57.550
She was able to use a Special Appeal during the entrance exam.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.610
I wonder if she's taken lessons before?

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:02.130
Hoshimiya Ichigo...

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.620
<i>Things have really heated up.</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.630
<i>Hurry and catch up with me!</i>

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:21.690
And so, the curtain on our idol activities,

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:23.570
Aikatsu, has finally raised!

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:27.800
Well now, I hope they enjoy the short time that they can remain friends.

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:08.340
We've finally entered Starlight Academy!

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:09.950
Isn't it exciting, Aoi?

00:24:09.950 --> 00:24:12.590
No matter what happens, we'll always be friends, Ichigo.

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:14.090
Huh? What do you mean?

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:15.850
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.310
Tons of idols!

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:19.860
Always passionate, Idol Activities!

00:24:31.010 --> 00:24:32.850
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:24:34.240 --> 00:24:36.330
One Mega Hamburger Bento!

00:24:36.330 --> 00:24:38.050
Ichigo, that supposed to be an aphorism?

00:24:38.050 --> 00:24:39.480
Then once more:

00:24:40.970 --> 00:24:42.900
To performers, these cards are life itself.

00:24:42.900 --> 00:24:44.410
Now that's what I'm talking about!
